              "segment": {
                "start_index": 507,
                "end_index": 702,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Actively Managed Funds:** For funds where a manager actively researches and selects stocks, the management fee typically ranges from **0.5% to 1.5%** of Assets Under Management (AUM) annually"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                0,
                1
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 704,
                "end_index": 870,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Passively Managed Funds (Index Funds):** If the fund simply tracks an index (like the S&P 500), the fees are much lower, typically ranging from **0.02% to 0.20%**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                3
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 872,
                "end_index": 1102,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **No Performance Fees:** Unlike hedge funds\u2014which famously charge a \"2 and 20\" fee (a 2% management fee plus **20% of all profits**)\u2014mutual funds are strictly regulated and almost **never charge a percentage of the profits**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1367,
                "end_index": 1543,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Instead, their compensation is determined by a corporate salary and bonus structure disclosed in the fund's SEC filings (specifically the *Statement of Additional Information*)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6
